    "snippet": "As expected, scattered showers and storms have developed across our northern/northwestern zones overnight in the left exit region of an upper-level jet streak. A secondary area of convection is beginning to form across Mohave, Lincoln, and northeastern Clark counties this morning as the jet streak translates east and robust moisture advection occurs.",
